{"version":"v1.0","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"gallery-pager","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","align":"stretch","children":["title","intro","label-banner","banner-box","banner-status","label-peek","cards","card-dots","label-steps","steps","step-dots","step-buttons"],"style":{"padding":16,"spacing":12}},{"id":"title","component":"Text","text":"Pager / DotIndicator","variant":"h3"},{"id":"intro","component":"Text","text":"Pager 横向一页一页吸附，只渲染当前页和两侧各一页；指示器是独立的 DotIndicator，两者只通过 data model 联系。每个 case 写明写法与预期。","variant":"body"},{"id":"label-banner","component":"Text","text":"1. Banner：loop + autoPlay 4000ms + aspectRatio 2，Box 叠加白色圆点。预期：每 4 秒前进一页，第 3 页之后回到第 0 页不倒退；按住时不翻；圆点跟随。","variant":"caption"},{"id":"banner-page","component":"Box","contentAlignment":"center","children":["banner-page-title"],"style":{"path":"style"}},{"id":"banner-page-title","component":"Text","text":{"path":"title"},"variant":"h3","style":{"color":"basic_alpha_always_white"}},{"id":"banner","component":"Pager","children":{"path":"/banners","componentId":"banner-page"},"currentPage":{"path":"/ui/bannerPage"},"loop":true,"autoPlay":{"interval":4000},"style":{"fillMaxWidth":1,"aspectRatio":2,"shape":12}},{"id":"banner-dots","component":"DotIndicator","count":{"path":"/banners"},"current":{"path":"/ui/bannerPage"},"style":{"padding":{"bottom":10},"activeColor":"basic_alpha_always_white","inactiveColor":"basic_alpha_always_white","activeDotWidth":14}},{"id":"banner-box","component":"Box","contentAlignment":"bottomCenter","children":["banner","banner-dots"],"style":{"fillMaxWidth":1}},{"id":"banner-status","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"当前页 /ui/bannerPage = ${/ui/bannerPage}"}},"variant":"footnote"},{"id":"label-peek","component":"Text","text":"2. 卡片流：peek 24 + pageSpacing 8，不循环；下方 interactive 圆点。预期：两侧各露出 24dp 的相邻页；点第 3 个圆点翻到第 3 页；在最后一页继续左滑不越界。","variant":"caption"},{"id":"card-page","component":"Card","children":["card-page-title","card-page-body"]},{"id":"card-page-title","component":"Text","text":{"path":"title"},"variant":"h4"},{"id":"card-page-body","component":"Text","text":{"path":"body"},"variant":"body"},{"id":"cards","component":"Pager","children":{"path":"/cards","componentId":"card-page"},"currentPage":{"path":"/ui/cardPage"},"style":{"peek":24,"pageSpacing":8}},{"id":"card-dots","component":"DotIndicator","count":{"path":"/cards"},"current":{"path":"/ui/cardPage"},"interactive":true,"style":{"dotSize":8,"activeDotWidth":20,"dotSpacing":8}},{"id":"label-steps","component":"Text","text":"3. 程序翻页：userScrollEnabled false，只能用按钮（updateData + add / subtract 写 currentPage）。预期：手势不翻页；下一步到末页后停住（越界被夹到末页并写回）；「跳到 9」显示最后一页、路径写回 3。","variant":"caption"},{"id":"step-0","component":"Box","contentAlignment":"center","children":["step-0-text"],"style":{"fillMaxWidth":1,"height":96,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary","shape":12}},{"id":"step-0-text","component":"Text","text":"第 1 步：填写信息","variant":"h4"},{"id":"step-1","component":"Box","contentAlignment":"center","children":["step-1-text"],"style":{"fillMaxWidth":1,"height":96,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary","shape":12}},{"id":"step-1-text","component":"Text","text":"第 2 步：选择套餐","variant":"h4"},{"id":"step-2","component":"Box","contentAlignment":"center","children":["step-2-text"],"style":{"fillMaxWidth":1,"height":96,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary","shape":12}},{"id":"step-2-text","component":"Text","text":"第 3 步：确认订单","variant":"h4"},{"id":"step-3","component":"Box","contentAlignment":"center","children":["step-3-text"],"style":{"fillMaxWidth":1,"height":96,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary","shape":12}},{"id":"step-3-text","component":"Text","text":"第 4 步：完成","variant":"h4"},{"id":"steps","component":"Pager","children":["step-0","step-1","step-2","step-3"],"currentPage":{"path":"/ui/step"},"userScrollEnabled":false,"style":{"height":96}},{"id":"step-dots","component":"DotIndicator","count":4,"current":{"path":"/ui/step"}},{"id":"step-prev-label","component":"Text","text":"上一步","variant":"body"},{"id":"step-prev","component":"Button","child":"step-prev-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/ui/step","value":{"call":"subtract","args":{"a":{"path":"/ui/step"},"b":1}}}]}}}},{"id":"step-next-label","component":"Text","text":"下一步","variant":"body"},{"id":"step-next","component":"Button","child":"step-next-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/ui/step","value":{"call":"add","args":{"a":{"path":"/ui/step"},"b":1}}}]}}}},{"id":"step-jump-label","component":"Text","text":"跳到 9","variant":"body"},{"id":"step-jump","component":"Button","child":"step-jump-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/ui/step","value":9}]}}}},{"id":"step-buttons","component":"Row","children":["step-prev","step-next","step-jump"],"style":{"spacing":8}}]}}
